WEBVTT

00:28:29.810 --> 00:28:32.086
And I've also called
for shorter workweeks.

00:28:32.110 --> 00:28:34.046
So at heart, I wanted to know

00:28:34.070 --> 00:28:36.159
that I wasn't the only
hypocrite out there.

00:28:36.183 --> 00:28:37.986
(Rutger laughs)

00:28:38.010 --> 00:28:39.868
RB: Yeah, we're both hypocrites.

00:28:39.892 --> 00:28:42.874
AG: Yeah, but I think maybe
the difference between

00:28:42.898 --> 00:28:45.506
our lives and the policy changes
we're calling for

00:28:45.530 --> 00:28:48.126
is we choose to work
this number of hours, right?

00:28:48.150 --> 00:28:50.578
I work as many hours as I do

00:28:50.602 --> 00:28:52.846
because I find my work
enjoyable and meaningful.

00:28:52.870 --> 00:28:56.966
And what I want is for the hundreds
of millions of people

00:28:56.990 --> 00:29:00.246
who hate their work
or who find it extremely stressful